# direnv: a `cd` in here enters flake.nix' devShells.default, so gleam, node and the pinned
# playwright-driver reach the PATH with no global install. nix-direnv caches the evaluation.
# ONCE PER CLONE: `direnv allow`. An .envrc is code that runs on entering the folder, so direnv
# demands explicit consent per file, which is why the file is versioned and the permission is not.
use flake
